{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S04、S13对人物动机的交代不如X完整，尤其弱化了想把当下的美好留住，以及害怕失去而想收回心意、最终又无法收回的心理过程。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的短句和重点加亮让普通观众更容易迅速抓住人物每一阶段的心理变化，不必先读完长句再自行提炼；感受文字又能跟随音乐分时出现，并且有具体的旋律、音色、力度、节奏和身体感受，听觉与情绪之间的对应更细腻。Y贯穿的水波、船体、漂浮意象也让前后形成了较完整的感受线索。X的优势是人物为什么这样想、为什么这样做交代得更充分，但整体更依赖阅读叙述来理解，音乐本身的细节转化为观众可感知体验的能力不如Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "21dc8799-5918-41f6-92e0-961135a14511", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T224704667404Z", "elapsed_seconds": 35.844, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:47:40.536053+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "788ddf67b4531c1e8bba45c2007c7a5e452e745493b615097f7beb205f21a612", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683"